# The desktop AUDIO options sub-screen: MASTER VOLUME, MUSIC VOLUME and
# VIBRATION (phone motor on touch, pad rumble on a controller). Route as
# camera.shot, then `key down` past P1..P4 SENSITIVITY, CAMERA, STAR
# DENSITY, HUD SIZE and RESOLUTION onto the AUDIO opener.
seed 3
menu
sim 4800
key enter 200
key down 700
key enter 1200
key down 1600
key down 1900
key down 2200
key down 2500
key down 2800
key down 3100
key down 3400
key down 3700
key enter 4200
